<title>SINGAPORE: Flextech active, one mln shares crossed.</title>
<headline>Flextech active, one mln shares crossed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore electronics firm Flextech Holdings topped the actives in early Friday trading as retail investors targeted low-priced stocks, dealers said.</p>
<p>Flextech also saw one million shares crossed at Singapore $0.935, they said.  </p>
<p>At 0135 GMT, Flextech rose S$0.055 to S$1.00 on 2.4 million shares.</p>
<p>&quot;Retailers have been targeting cheap stocks and electronic stocks are among them,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
